  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Everybody loves Lucy's Cottage! Beautiful home with 4 bedrooms and 3 baths, perfect for family getaways in Seagrove Beach. This private gated community is located at 30A and Robert-Ellis Drive. A mere 400 yards from front-door to the beach with a large community pool, right in the community. <br><br>Enter the large living space with high ceilings and large 60” TV. A gourmet kitchen with granite Counter tops, fully stocked kitchen, and fridge with a ice maker. Easy access bedroom on main floor with full bath.<br>The primary bedroom is located on the top floor with private balcony and master bath suite with rain head shower. Snuggle up in the king bed and watch a movie or read a book on your private balcony and hear the beach. Their are 3 bedrooms with queen beds. Hang out in the back patio and have a Bbq or relax on one of the two porches. Plenty of room to hang out all together in the living room, or in small groups on the different porches and patio.<br>Lucy’s Cottage biggest draw is the excellent location. Grab a slice of pizza on the way down to the beach. Or walk down to the donut hole in the morning for iced coffee and bacon covered donuts- YUM. The seafood market is a quick 5 minute walk where you can fresh seafood, including fresh to order steamed shrimp! Bikes can be rented on the corner and now you can ride down to Seaside, Grayton, or The HUB. Lucy’s Cottage is right in the middle of everything that is 30A!<br><br>",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Lucy’s Cottage Perfect Location with 5 min walk to beach, restaurants and shops"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
